    <item>
      <title>Trump Flaunts Camaraderie With Xi and Putin but Has Little to Show for It</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/asia/trump-xi-putin.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/asia/trump-xi-putin.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:14:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/19/multimedia/19trump-summits-ledeall-01-cvbz/19trump-summits-ledeall-01-cvbz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/19/multimedia/19trump-summits-ledeall-01-cvbz/19trump-summits-ledeall-01-cvbz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/19/multimedia/19trump-summits-ledeall-01-cvbz/19trump-summits-ledeall-01-cvbz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Trump Flaunts Camaraderie With Xi and Putin but Has Little to Show for It" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;President Trump called Russia’s leader his “friend” and marveled at China’s warm welcome for his first-ever trilateral summit. But there were no breakthroughs on nuclear control, the war in Ukraine or A.I.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <source url="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/asia/trump-xi-putin.html">The New York Times</source>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>At Summit With Xi and Putin, Trump Seeks to Project Power Abroad While Sharing It at Home</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/us/politics/trump-summit-power.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/us/politics/trump-summit-power.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:05:18 +0000</pubDate>
      <enclosure url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/19/multimedia/19trump-power-jpck/19trump-power-jpck-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg" />
      <media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/19/multimedia/19trump-power-jpck/19trump-power-jpck-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" medium="image" />
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/19/multimedia/19trump-power-jpck/19trump-power-jpck-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="At Summit With Xi and Putin, Trump Seeks to Project Power Abroad While Sharing It at Home" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Weakened by the midterm elections, President Trump offered hugs, arm pats and smiles to autocrats from Russia and China in contrast to the threats he is making to ascendant Democrats in Washington.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <source url="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/us/politics/trump-summit-power.html">The New York Times</source>
    </item>
